  "hook": "Home of the second Hunters Point Food Cooperative, founded in the 1960s.",
  "historical_record": [
    {
      "date": "1967",
      "kind": "community use",
      "description": "The second Hunters Point Food Cooperative operated here, spun off from a cooperative of the late 1930s and supplying inexpensive groceries to its members and to neighbours ill-served by the traditional grocery stores, many of which had closed in the preceding years. The building is now Cornerstone Mission Baptist Church.",
